UnitPPYieldToken::constructor
├── When admin is the zero address
│   └── It should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
├── When initial fee exceeds max
│   └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_FeeTooHigh
└── When called with valid parameters
    ├── It sets feeBps and admin
    ├── It sets the asset name symbol and decimals
    └── It initializes accounting to zero

UnitPPYieldToken::decimals
├── It returns 18
└── It offset is twelve

UnitPPYieldToken::deposit
├── Given total supply is zero_ when assets is zero
│   └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_ZeroShares
├── Given total supply is zero_ when called with valid assets
│   ├── It emits a Deposit event
│   ├── It mints assets shares and pulls the assets
│   └── It sets lastCheckpointBalance and leaves accumulatedFees at zero
├── Given total supply is non zero_ given yield has accrued
│   ├── It checkpoints fee delta into accumulatedFees
│   ├── It sets lastCheckpointBalance to the post deposit balance
│   └── It mints fewer than one to one shares since the rate rose
├── Given total supply is non zero_ given no yield
│   └── It leaves accumulatedFees unchanged and mints at the current rate
├── When the deposit would mint zero shares
│   └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_ZeroShares
└── When the caller has insufficient allowance
    └── It should revert with ERC20InsufficientAllowance

UnitPPYieldToken::maxDeposit
├── Given not paused
│   └── It returns uint max
└── Given paused
    └── It returns zero while paused

UnitPPYieldToken::mint
├── When shares is zero
│   └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_ZeroShares
└── When called with valid shares
    └── It pulls previewMint assets and mints exactly shares

UnitPPYieldToken::withdraw
├── When assets is zero
│   └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_ZeroAssets
├── Given yield has accrued
│   ├── It emits a Withdraw event
│   └── It transfers assets checkpoints the fee and updates lastCheckpointBalance
├── When withdraw exceeds max withdraw
│   └── It should revert with ERC4626ExceededMaxWithdraw
└── When withdrawing on behalf without allowance
    └── It should revert with ERC20InsufficientAllowance

UnitPPYieldToken::redeem
├── When shares is zero
│   └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_ZeroAssets
├── When redeem would return zero assets
│   └── It should revert with PPYieldToken_ZeroAssets
├── When called with valid shares
│   ├── It returns principal plus net delta and checkpoints the fee
│   └── It leaves the protocol fee in the vault
└── When redeem exceeds max redeem
    └── It should revert with ERC4626ExceededMaxRedeem

UnitPPYieldToken::claimFees
├── When the caller is not admin
│   └── It should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── Given there are accumulated and pending fees
│   ├── It emits a FeesClaimed event
│   └── It sweeps the fee zeroes accumulatedFees and preserves the exchange rate
├── Given there are only pending fees
│   └── It checkpoints and sweeps the pending portion
└── Given there are zero fees
    └── It emits a FeesClaimed event with amount zero and transfers nothing

UnitPPYieldToken::totalAssets
├── Given no yield
│   └── It returns aUSDC balance minus accumulatedFees
├── Given pending yield
│   └── It returns balance minus accumulatedFees plus pending fee
└── Given balance is below current fees
    └── It returns zero clamped

UnitPPYieldToken::exchangeRate
├── When total supply is zero
│   └── It returns the base rate
├── When total supply is non zero
│   └── It returns convertToAssets of one whole share
└── Given yield has accrued
    └── It increases relative to before net of the fee

UnitPPYieldToken::claimableFees
├── Given no yield
│   └── It returns accumulatedFees
└── Given pending yield
    └── It returns accumulatedFees plus fee delta

UnitPPYieldToken::feeAccrual
├── Given the fee is non zero
│   ├── It accrues fee delta to the protocol
│   └── It credits net delta to holders via the exchange rate
├── Given the fee is zero
│   └── It accrues no fee and credits all yield to holders
├── Given yield accrues across multiple intervals
│   └── It accumulates fees additively across checkpoints
├── Given a donation directly to the vault
│   └── It treats the donation as yield
└── Given a fuzzed sequence of actions
    └── It never lets total redeemable plus accumulatedFees exceed the balance

UnitPPYieldToken::inflationAttack
└── Given a one wei seed and large donation
    └── It still mints non zero shares to a normal second depositor

UnitPPYieldToken::noLeakRoundTrip
└── Given a deposit then immediate redeem with no yield
    └── It returns approximately N aUSDC and zeroes total supply

UnitPPYieldToken::lossHandling
├── Given balance drops_ holders bear it no fee
│   ├── It accrues no fee on a drop and reflects the loss in net assets
│   └── It still lets the holder exit bearing the loss pro rata
└── Given recovery below last checkpoint_ accrues no fee
    └── It charges no fee on recovery below the last checkpoint

UnitPPYieldToken::maxMint
├── Given not paused
│   └── It returns uint max
└── Given paused
    └── It returns zero while paused

UnitPPYieldToken::mint
└── Given yield has accrued
    └── It checkpoints the fee on the prior yield and mints exactly shares

UnitPPYieldToken::redeem
└── When redeeming on behalf without allowance
    └── It should revert with ERC20InsufficientAllowance
